      ["Please fill out this form.","/pliːz fɪl‿aʊt ðɪs fɔːrm/","Thov sau daim ntawv no.","fill out (Phrasal verbs). Sau koj lub npe thiab koj chaw nyob."],
      ["What's your address?","/wʌts jʊr ˈædres/","Koj chaw nyob yog qhov twg?","Teb: tsev, txoj kev, lub nroog."],
      ["My daughter goes to school here.","/maɪ ˈdɑːtɚ goʊz tə skuːl hɪr/","Kuv tus ntxhais mus kawm ntawv ntawm no.","goes to school: tsis muaj the."],
      ["This is my child's teacher.","/ðɪs‿ɪz maɪ tʃaɪldz ˈtiːtʃɚ/","Nov yog kuv tus me nyuam tus xib fwb.","child's = ntawm kuv tus me nyuam."],
      ["My kids are at school.","/maɪ kɪdz‿ɑːr ət skuːl/","Kuv cov me nyuam nyob tom tsev kawm ntawv.","kids = children. at school: tsis muaj the."],
      ["Which bus goes to the clinic?","/wɪtʃ bʌs goʊz tə ðə ˈklɪnɪk/","Lub tsheb ntiav twg mus tsev kho mob?","goes: bus yog ib lub, zoo li it."],
      ["The bus is late.","/ðə bʌs‿ɪz leɪt/","Lub tsheb ntiav tseem tsis tuaj.","late = lig."],
      ["It's snowing.","/ɪts ˈsnoʊɪŋ/","Los daus.","Zoo li It's raining: it + be + -ing."],
      ["Can I get an interpreter, please?","/kən‿aɪ get‿ən‿ɪnˈtɝːprətɚ pliːz/","Kuv thov ib tug neeg txhais lus puas tau?","Hais tom tsev kho mob, tsev kawm ntawv los yog lub nroog. Neeg txhais lus pub dawb rau koj."],
      ["I need to go to the county office.","/aɪ niːd tə goʊ tə ðə ˈkaʊnti ˈɑːfɪs/","Kuv yuav tsum mus tom chaw ua hauj lwm ntawm lub nroog.","county = lub nroog. office = chaw ua hauj lwm. Nqa koj cov ntawv mus."],
      ["My grandma doesn't speak English.","/maɪ ˈgrænmɑː ˈdʌzənt spiːk‿ˈɪŋglɪʃ/","Kuv pog tsis hais lus Askiv.","grandma = pog los yog niam tais. she → doesn't."],
      ["We're going to the Hmong New Year.","/wɪr ˈgoʊɪŋ tə ðə mɑːŋ nuː jɪr/","Peb mus noj peb caug.","Hmong New Year = noj peb caug. Muaj nyob Fresno, St. Paul thiab ntau lub nroog."],
      ["Happy Hmong New Year!","/ˈhæpi mɑːŋ nuː jɪr/","Nyob zoo xyoo tshiab!","Teb: Thank you, you too!"]
